1
00:00:00,884 --> 00:00:03,784
(Raj:)That is so
generous of you.

2
00:00:03,787 --> 00:00:07,787
(Raj:)I'd like to switch sides.

3
00:00:07,791 --> 00:00:09,061
(Howard:)Look, uh...

4
00:00:09,059 --> 00:00:10,659
(Howard:)I don't even think
you can take this wall down

5
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:11,860
(Howard:)'cause it's load-bearing.

6
00:00:11,862 --> 00:00:13,132
(Raj:)Well, it's easy to find out.

7
00:00:13,130 --> 00:00:15,330
(Raj:)Just go into the crawlspace
under the house and check.

8
00:00:15,332 --> 00:00:18,062
(Howard:)When is your visa up?

9
00:00:20,837 --> 00:00:23,537
(Sheldon:)Not only is it signed to me

10
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:25,370
(Sheldon:)but this is where he wiped
his mouth.

11
00:00:25,375 --> 00:00:29,845
(Sheldon:)So we are currently in the
presence of Leonard Nimoy's DNA.

12
00:00:29,846 --> 00:00:33,316
(Wil:)Um, doesn't Adam count
as Leonard Nimoy's DNA?

13
00:00:33,316 --> 00:00:37,256
No offense, but this is
pure 100% Nimoy.

14
00:00:37,254 --> 00:00:40,054
(Sheldon:)Because of your mother,
you're only 50%.

15
00:00:40,057 --> 00:00:42,627
(Sheldon:)Which isn't bad,

16
00:00:42,626 --> 00:00:46,466
(Sheldon:)but anything that you wipe
your mouth on gets thrown away.

17
00:00:47,597 --> 00:00:48,797
(Penny:)Okay, enough
about the napkin.

18
00:00:48,799 --> 00:00:49,829
(Penny:)What else you
hiding in there?

19
00:00:49,833 --> 00:00:51,103
(Sheldon:)Wouldn't you like
to know?

20
00:00:51,101 --> 00:00:52,771
(Penny:)I would.
All right then.

21
00:00:53,637 --> 00:00:54,707
(Sheldon:)See? Just my valuables.

22
00:00:54,704 --> 00:00:58,474
(Sheldon:)My passport, uh, my will...
You have a will?

23
00:00:58,475 --> 00:01:02,025
(Sheldon:)Yeah... my 1/18 scale
Wil Wheaton action figure.

